Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.11,Default,Hk,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.11,0:00:12.24,Default,Hk,0,0,0,,Draw them closer!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.79,0:00:17.49,Default,Hk,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.50,0:00:24.29,Default,D,0,0,0,,Yoshitatsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.29,0:00:28.08,Default,D,0,0,0,,War isn't simply a matter of\Noverwhelming the enemy.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.76,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Inaba has betrayed us!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.76,0:00:36.43,Default,D,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.43,0:00:41.38,Default,D,0,0,0,,Ujiie and Andou have also defected!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.38,0:00:45.64,Default,D,0,0,0,,The Mino Three have all betrayed us?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.75,0:00:50.32,Default,Y,0,0,0,,You've brought this on yourself, Father!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.93,0:00:53.82,Default,Y,0,0,0,,I won't allow you to turn Mino \NProvince over to that fool of a princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.07,0:00:58.03,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Kill Saitou Dousan!
