Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.93,0:02:31.12,Default,N,0,0,0,,Saitou Yoshitatsu rebelled?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.75,0:02:35.76,Default,G,0,0,0,,All the nobles... of Mino \NProvince... are siding with him.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.76,0:02:36.63,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.63,0:02:40.51,Default,G,0,0,0,,Saitou Yoshitatsu... is who they'd rather... have lead.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.51,0:02:42.56,Default,I,0,0,0,,Stop pausing while you speak!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,You know that ain't happening.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.97,0:02:48.52,Default,G,0,0,0,,Dousan has left Inabayama Castle,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.95,0:02:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and is fighting an army that outnumbers his almost ten-to-one at the Nagara river.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.25,0:02:56.65,Default,G,0,0,0,,The combat is fierce and...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.25,0:02:58.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,Told you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.66,0:03:00.02,Default,I,0,0,0,,That's insanity.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.02,0:03:02.28,Default,I,0,0,0,,Engaging them whilst in \Nthe open and outnumbered...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.77,0:03:06.16,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Count Dousan intends to die there.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.03,0:03:11.42,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,If he forces them to siege his castle,\Nour princess will send reinforcements.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.42,0:03:14.26,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,That would mean that\NImagawa Yoshimoto
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.26,0:03:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,would be certain to attack \Nthe now-empty Owari Province.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.42,0:03:20.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,849)\t(2861,3696,\c&HFAFAFA&)\t(2861,3696,\3c&HFAFAFA&)}He wants to die before Nobuna acts?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.13,0:03:26.52,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Such resolve is worthy of \Nthe title, "Viper of Mino."
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.52,0:03:28.12,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Sixty points.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's a low score for such a compliment.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.95,0:03:33.22,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,When I think of how the princess feels...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.07,0:03:35.24,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.03,0:03:37.69,Default,N,0,0,0,,I've heard what happened in Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.21,0:03:40.21,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,So, as for the reinforcements...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.21,0:03:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't send any.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.56,0:03:42.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.01,0:03:44.84,Default,N,0,0,0,,If we went to save him,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.84,0:03:46.45,Default,N,0,0,0,,he'd only lecture me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.61,0:03:48.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,You okay with that?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.58,0:03:50.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,What's that look for?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.83,Default,N,0,0,0,,Would you rather see me lose my head?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.83,0:03:55.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,Well, no, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.41,0:03:57.18,Default,N,0,0,0,,Then let me ask you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.34,Default,N,0,0,0,,If I said I would send \Nreinforcements, would you let me?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.56,Default,N,0,0,0,,Okay! This conversation's over.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.56,0:04:06.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.95,0:04:10.27,Default,N,0,0,0,,I said it's over, so it's over!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.27,0:04:13.10,Default,N,0,0,0,,Don't forget your place, \Nyou stupid monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.87,0:04:24.28,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's just like with Nobukatsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.51,0:04:34.08,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I can understand why Imagawa \Nwould want this place.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.45,0:04:36.02,Default,So,0,0,0,,As do you, yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.89,0:04:39.59,Default,Am,0,0,0,,But the princess of the Oda is \Nthe greatest fool in the land.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.09,0:04:42.46,Default,Am,0,0,0,,She may head to Mino on her own.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.46,0:04:45.34,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Then we're going with the Imagawa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.77,0:04:48.09,Default,Am,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto's a woman, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.09,0:04:50.85,Default,So,0,0,0,,She'll be easy for you to seduce.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.93,0:04:55.70,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I pity all the women who try to \Nrule during this Sengoku Era.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.35,0:04:58.61,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I'll take advantage of them all.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.13,0:05:03.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.97,0:05:05.90,Default,N,0,0,0,,Don't come in without asking.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.57,0:05:11.74,Default,S,0,0,0,,When it seemed like you didn't \Ncare about the Viper, I just...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.27,0:05:14.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,I know you really want to save him, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.73,0:05:17.06,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.27,0:05:20.63,Default,N,0,0,0,,Will the Viper die?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.47,0:05:30.90,Default,N,0,0,0,,The person who gave me this \Nwas a barbarian missionary.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.59,0:05:34.30,Default,S,0,0,0,,The person you care about?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.30,0:05:36.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,As I was learning from them,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.30,0:05:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided I wanted to unite \NJapan and travel the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.51,0:05:43.70,Default,N,0,0,0,,That individual, who had come from across the sea,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.70,0:05:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,was the beginning of my dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.55,0:05:48.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'd like to meet that person, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.79,0:05:50.91,Default,N,0,0,0,,He's already dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.35,0:05:53.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.01,0:05:59.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,For some reason, all of the \Npeople I love die quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.97,0:06:02.23,Default,N,0,0,0,,It was like that with Father, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.23,0:06:03.76,Default,N,0,0,0,,And now, the Viper.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.07,0:06:09.43,Default,N,0,0,0,,Maybe I can't love anybody.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.29,0:06:11.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.41,0:06:14.92,Default,N,0,0,0,,Your face says, "I'm not going to die."
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.49,0:06:18.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm pretty stubborn that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.16,0:06:19.69,Default,N,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.69,0:06:22.90,Default,N,0,0,0,,After all, I'll never love you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.74,Default,S,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.74,0:06:26.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's harsh.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.81,0:06:31.45,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I am the head of the Asai \Nclan, Asai Nagamasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.85,0:06:36.40,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I'm very honored to meet \Nsuch a beautiful princess.
