Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.53,0:06:48.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,Look at that asshole's smirk!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.72,0:06:51.51,Default,N,0,0,0,,Come on, quiet down, Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.51,0:06:53.70,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,You have a pet monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.70,0:06:54.92,Default,N,0,0,0,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.92,0:06:56.70,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'm still training him.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.25,0:07:01.10,Default,N,0,0,0,,More importantly, what do you want?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.03,0:07:06.45,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I've come to remove the cause of \Nyour suffering, Princess Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.45,0:07:08.36,Default,N,0,0,0,,My suffering?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.27,0:07:11.36,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Saitou Dousan of Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.09,0:07:16.53,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,As things are, he'll die within days.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.53,0:07:18.62,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,But the Oda cannot act.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.47,0:07:20.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.15,0:07:24.70,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,If the Asai and Oda attack from\Nthe north and south simultaneously,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.70,0:07:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the battle will end swiftly.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.23,0:07:30.10,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,You'll be able to rescue Dousan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.72,0:07:35.42,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,And with Oumi, Mino, and Owari united,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.42,0:07:37.58,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,even the Imagawa will not be able to stand against us.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.11,0:07:40.23,Default,N,0,0,0,,You're proposing an alliance?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.61,0:07:43.23,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Doesn't it sound good?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.45,0:07:47.98,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}Too{\i0} good.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.33,0:07:51.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,What are you really after?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.55,0:07:54.90,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.59,0:07:58.12,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,You're quite unlike the stories I've heard.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.85,0:08:01.24,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Well, then I'll be honest.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.93,0:08:03.37,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.05,0:08:08.88,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I've come to make you my wife.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.20,Default,Dousan,0,0,0,,We're losing badly.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.20,0:08:17.89,Default,Akechi,0,0,0,,What kind of monster \Nattacks his own father?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.49,0:08:19.72,Default,D,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.55,0:08:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had even a portion of my blood,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.18,0:08:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he could have been friends \Nwith young Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.63,0:08:30.74,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Count Dousan, Inoue \Nhas perished in battle.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.27,0:08:32.34,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Many have left us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy now number above 15,000.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.61,0:08:36.86,Default,Akechi,0,0,0,,None of them have the \Nslightest bit of loyalty!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.86,0:08:38.42,Default,D,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.54,0:08:44.40,Default,D,0,0,0,,It may be impossible for any of them\Nto understand young Nobuna's genius.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.13,0:08:48.29,Default,D,0,0,0,,Mitsuhide.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.19,0:08:51.30,Default,D,0,0,0,,I have a request for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.01,0:08:54.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,Y-Y-You want to get married?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.79,0:08:57.93,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,We'll be the most beautiful couple in Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.93,0:09:02.64,Default,N,0,0,0,,I-I-It's just way too sudden! That's crazy!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.64,0:09:03.34,Default,N,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,Beautiful couple?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,He's right! He's better looking than I am!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.69,0:09:11.69,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Let us conquer Japan together, Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.69,0:09:15.20,Default,N,0,0,0,,D-D-Does that mean you're in love with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.43,0:09:18.07,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.28,0:09:21.79,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Political marriages are the way of the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.79,0:09:25.29,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,If anything, love gets in the way.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.79,0:09:31.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,What a jerk!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.08,0:09:32.17,Default,N,0,0,0,,I want to...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.63,0:09:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,choose my own husband.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.27,0:09:37.80,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'm going to marry the person I love.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.23,0:09:40.35,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's my dream!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.35,0:09:42.31,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Have you already decided on someone?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.56,Default,N,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.56,0:09:47.60,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Oh, is it the monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.60,0:09:48.69,Default,N,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.75,0:09:51.86,Default,N,0,0,0,,This ape... is just my servant!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.86,0:09:55.19,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'm never ever going to marry him!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.87,0:09:57.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,What are you kicking me for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.86,0:09:59.60,Default,N,0,0,0,,You say something, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.60,0:10:02.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,But I'm just a servant.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.99,0:10:05.16,Default,N,0,0,0,,You're giving up because he's \Nbetter looking than you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,You're lame!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.81,0:10:09.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,Who's giving up on what?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.38,Default,N,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.07,0:10:14.12,Default,N,0,0,0,,You're about to lose the \Nprettiest girl in the land!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.12,0:10:15.18,Default,N,0,0,0,,Doesn't that bother you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.18,0:10:16.01,Default,N,0,0,0,,It does, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you don't want to \Ndo it, then just refuse.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.80,0:10:22.02,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'll marry Nagamasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.02,0:10:23.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,Go on, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.08,0:10:27.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,I won't miss a girl who marries \Nsomeone who doesn't love her!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.44,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.57,0:10:34.00,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,A lovers' quarrel in front of \Nanother count is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.00,0:10:35.18,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Five points.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.18,0:10:36.44,Default,N,0,0,0,,Lovers' quarrel?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.22,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,That was certainly an unexpected ambush.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.22,0:10:42.45,Default,N,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.22,0:10:47.96,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,But if you refuse the marriage, Dousan will die.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.75,0:10:50.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,You bastard! Are you blackmailing her?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.16,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Without Dousan in Mino and facing the Imagawa,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.16,0:10:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,if you make an enemy of the Asai \Nas well, the Oda clan will fall.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.93,0:11:01.04,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,You'd do well to think this over.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.67,0:11:06.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.71,0:11:15.48,Default,N,0,0,0,,There's still a way to save Count Dousan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.07,0:11:17.72,Default,N,0,0,0,,The knowledge of that
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.72,0:11:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,brought back all the emotions\Nshe had sealed within her heat.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.49,0:11:23.86,Default,I,0,0,0,,But she can't marry that man!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.86,0:11:25.37,Default,H,0,0,0,,I feel bad for the princess.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.09,0:11:29.18,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,The Imagawa armies gather at our borders.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.18,0:11:30.87,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,We cannot go on our own.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.97,0:11:35.63,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,And the alliance is the \Nstrategically correct choice.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.95,0:11:38.32,Default,I,0,0,0,,You're not going to accept \Nthis marriage are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.13,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,If the Oda Clan's only interest \Nis in conquering Japan,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.57,0:11:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,this marriage is...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.49,0:11:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,seventy points.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.43,0:11:47.31,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.57,0:11:53.94,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,If we think of our princess, \Nthen it's less than zero points.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.77,0:11:56.94,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Women are not tools of conquest!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.27,0:11:59.32,Default,I,0,0,0,,Nagahide...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.53,0:12:03.12,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,With all of the wars going on,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.73,0:12:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd at least hoped our princess...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.07,0:12:09.83,Default,I,0,0,0,,Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.07,0:12:13.52,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,...ended up with someone she liked.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.55,0:12:20.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey, lowlife!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.65,0:12:23.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you want to seduce a girl,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.10,0:12:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,there are better ways to go about it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.27,0:12:28.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,She may not look it,\Nbut Nobuna's very naïve!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.76,0:12:32.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,A loveless marriage proposal is \Ntoo much of a shock for her!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.32,0:12:34.35,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,A man's jealousy is an ugly thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.35,0:12:36.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,Th-That's not it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.48,0:12:38.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,I won't say that a political \Nmarriage is a bad thing,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.96,0:12:41.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,but you should at least \Ntell her you like her!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.75,0:12:45.49,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Telling a lie like that is worse.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.01,0:12:47.86,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,If you want to be a countess,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.86,0:12:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to throw away any \Nchance of happiness as a woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.89,0:12:54.67,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,You can't stay a woman if you\Nwant to survive the Sengoku Era.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.13,0:13:00.76,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,If she hopes for both love\Nand the unification of Japan,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.76,0:13:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it's better that someone make her give up that naïve dream early.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.13,0:13:06.01,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,That's the kind thing to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.83,0:13:08.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.08,0:13:11.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,I swore I'd make her dream come true!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.53,0:13:16.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,If she won't give up \Non conquest or love,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.25,0:13:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,310)\t(2970,3262,\c&HE2CECD&)\t(2970,3262,\3c&HE2CECD&)}I'll make sure she gets both of them!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.21,0:13:23.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,So... So, if you could at least...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.07,0:13:26.84,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I don't love her.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.84,0:13:28.48,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,And I never will.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.48,0:13:29.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.72,0:13:33.37,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep having \Nher carve up provinces.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.63,0:13:36.87,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,For me, her husband.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.87,0:13:40.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.43,0:13:45.14,Default,In,0,0,0,,No, Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.14,0:13:46.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,Let me go, Inuchiyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.64,0:13:49.68,Default,In,0,0,0,,If you hit him, there'll be war.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.35,0:13:52.44,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,You're just one of her retainers.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.44,0:13:55.18,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,No matter how much you\Nlove her, it will never be.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.35,0:13:58.10,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.63,0:14:01.78,Default,S,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.95,0:14:11.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,Never, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.79,0:14:26.62,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Have you made your decision, Nobuna?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.61,0:14:30.47,Default,N,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.47,0:14:33.97,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,This will solve all your problems.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.21,0:14:38.38,Default,N,0,0,0,,I... I will m... ma—
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.49,0:14:40.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.41,0:14:43.90,Default,S,0,0,0,,I won't give Nobuna to you!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.69,0:14:45.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.73,0:14:47.04,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.07,0:14:51.46,Default,S,0,0,0,,I mean the Oda aren't going \Nto be the Asai's slaves.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.46,0:14:52.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.56,0:14:53.62,Default,N,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.99,0:14:56.34,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Get out of here, Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.34,0:14:57.64,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,This is a matter between count—
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.64,0:15:00.19,Default,I,0,0,0,,I won't give our princess
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.19,0:15:02.50,Default,I,0,0,0,,to a womanizer like you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.93,0:15:06.44,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,You both lose points for not being \Nhonest with yourselves, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.01,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,eighty points.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.73,0:15:11.18,Default,H,0,0,0,,Discussions are over.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.59,0:15:15.68,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I hope you don't regret it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.09,0:15:21.02,Default,All,0,0,0,,I'm glad that's over.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.29,0:15:30.53,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Akechi Mitsuhide has come from Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.55,0:15:37.70,Default,N,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.87,0:15:39.92,Default,N,0,0,0,,Where's the Viper?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.51,0:15:42.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,The Viper's with you, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.83,0:15:51.13,Default,Akechi,0,0,0,,Count Dousan's daughter, Mistress Kichou.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.13,0:15:53.39,Default,N,0,0,0,,What happened to the Viper?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.57,0:15:56.39,Default,Akechi,0,0,0,,I have a letter.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.85,0:16:00.39,Default,N,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna, my daughter.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.77,0:16:06.34,Default,N,0,0,0,,When I met you, I learned \Nthat my dream was not over.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.34,0:16:10.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,I learned that the life I spent \Nexpanding my borders was not in vain.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.30,0:16:12.53,Default,N,0,0,0,,I could have no greater joy.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.53,0:16:15.53,Default,N,0,0,0,,All men will die someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.53,0:16:18.08,Default,N,0,0,0,,The time to say goodbye \Nwill come to us all.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.54,0:16:24.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,If Oda Nobuna will carry on the dream of the Viper, that is enough for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.54,0:16:30.48,Default,N,0,0,0,,I leave now for the next world, \Npraying that your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.55,0:16:37.18,Default,Akechi,0,0,0,,C-Count Dousan repeats: \Nhe does not need reinforcements...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.43,0:16:41.46,Default,N,0,0,0,,All forces...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.44,Default,N,0,0,0,,All forces, march—
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.44,0:16:43.94,Default,I,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.85,0:16:47.58,Default,N,0,0,0,,...for Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,K-Katsuie!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.72,0:16:52.86,Default,I,0,0,0,,We can't send reinforcements!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.86,0:16:56.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,When she wakes, do you intend \Non telling her Dousan died?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.43,0:16:59.33,Default,I,0,0,0,,What else can we do?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.29,0:17:03.00,Default,S,0,0,0,,Send out a strike force \Nto rescue Dousan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.00,0:17:04.89,Default,I,0,0,0,,But they'll never survive!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.18,Default,I,0,0,0,,Who would we send?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.95,0:17:09.06,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.21,0:17:11.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thanks, Goemon.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.62,0:17:13.80,Default,H,0,0,0,,A servant should do \Nanything for their lord.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.87,0:17:17.61,Default,Thugs,0,0,0,,Boss, we going to war?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.61,0:17:20.22,Default,G,0,0,0,,We steal the Viper of Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.82,Default,Thugs,0,0,0,,Sounds like a big job.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.85,0:17:30.88,Default,Dousan,0,0,0,,Anyone who makes it through the enemy lines alive, head to my daughter in Owari!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.49,0:17:35.86,Default,Dousan,0,0,0,,I'll show you how a viper dies!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.86,0:17:37.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.36,0:17:39.87,Default,Dousan,0,0,0,,Boy, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.24,0:17:42.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're coming with us, old man.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.99,0:17:44.06,Default,Dousan,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.06,0:17:45.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,You stubborn old man!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.50,0:17:49.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,Do you know how sad \NNobuna will be if you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.50,0:17:51.25,Default,D,0,0,0,,You stupid fool!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.25,0:17:53.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.01,0:17:56.01,Default,D,0,0,0,,What if {\i1}you{\i0} die here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.01,0:17:59.83,Default,D,0,0,0,,You are her one hope.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.83,0:18:01.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,I-I am?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.69,0:18:05.79,Default,D,0,0,0,,A dream is a dream because \Nyou share it with someone.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.79,0:18:10.77,Default,D,0,0,0,,You are from the future, and the only\None who can understand her dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.35,0:18:14.69,Default,D,0,0,0,,A dream only one person \Nhas is nothing but ambition.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.69,0:18:18.62,Default,D,0,0,0,,Will this land be burned by \Nambition or brightened by dreams?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.62,0:18:21.78,Default,D,0,0,0,,Its fate rests on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.85,0:18:25.29,Default,D,0,0,0,,Lead Nobuna for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.05,0:18:27.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.87,0:18:31.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,But I'm taking you back with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.04,0:18:33.55,Default,D,0,0,0,,Y-You moron!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.55,0:18:36.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,She's not honest with \Nherself, and she's a brat,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.70,0:18:38.80,Default,S,0,0,0,,but she accidentally told me how she felt!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.41,0:18:43.68,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,59)}For some reason, all of the \Npeople I love die quickly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.09,0:18:48.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,I never want to see her that sad again!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.97,0:18:55.94,Default,N,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.25,0:19:04.16,Default,N,0,0,0,,What happened in Mino?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.85,0:19:06.54,Default,N,0,0,0,,Where's Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.93,0:19:10.67,Default,I,0,0,0,,Um, well... Basically...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.89,0:19:13.42,Default,N,0,0,0,,Where did he go?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.83,0:19:15.55,Default,H,0,0,0,,Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.85,0:19:20.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hurry, Goemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.63,0:19:24.22,Default,G,0,0,0,,I'm giving it my all!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.41,0:19:31.56,Default,Thugs,0,0,0,,We're sitting ducks out here!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.56,0:19:34.52,Default,D,0,0,0,,We'll have to trust our luck to heaven.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.27,0:19:38.80,Default,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,Fire! Keep on firing!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.80,0:19:41.78,Default,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,Don't let my father escape!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.57,0:19:57.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,Props, Goemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.20,0:19:58.09,Default,G,0,0,0,,Props?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.45,0:20:00.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,It means "Thank you."
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.53,0:20:03.70,Default,D,0,0,0,,H-Hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.31,0:20:08.12,Default,Thugs,0,0,0,,Count Dousan, I hope your dream comes true.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.12,0:20:08.85,Default,Thugs,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.45,0:20:14.82,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.27,0:20:17.88,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sagara, any plans?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.88,0:20:20.87,Default,S,0,0,0,,Didn't that "game" of yours \Ntell you anything about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.87,0:20:22.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,This wasn't part of the game!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.32,0:20:25.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,We'll have to make it on our own!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.09,0:20:28.98,Default,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,My father will soon \Nbe arriving in Owari.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.16,0:20:32.14,Default,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.85,0:20:34.29,Default,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.63,0:20:36.04,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.59,0:20:42.38,Default,G,0,0,0,,We're through!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.38,0:20:44.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,We made it to Owari, old man!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.13,0:20:47.10,Default,D,0,0,0,,Not yet, boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.10,0:20:50.14,Default,D,0,0,0,,Yoshitatsu will not give up so easily.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.43,0:20:53.76,Default,G,0,0,0,,We need to run!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.76,0:20:55.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,We can't. The horses are faster!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.17,0:20:59.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,So, this is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.03,0:21:09.37,Default,N,0,0,0,,Push the Yoshitatsu army back!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.41,Default,N,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.92,0:21:20.17,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.45,0:21:26.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,What's Nobuna doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.92,0:21:29.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,And why has she brought \Nhalf the Owari army?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.63,0:21:32.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,If we leave Owari defenseless,\NImagawa will attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.41,0:21:35.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobody stopped her?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.27,0:21:41.07,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,We tried. But she insisted...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.43,0:21:42.74,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.38,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's your fault!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.38,0:21:51.58,Default,N,0,0,0,,You just went and left me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.89,0:21:53.90,Default,N,0,0,0,,You can't even use a spear!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.90,0:21:55.46,Default,N,0,0,0,,What if you had died?!
